<script setup lang="ts">import {computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {runs} from '../stores/runs';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import BlendMetrics from '../components/BlendMetrics.vue';import RecipeBars from '../components/RecipeBars.vue';import QualityTable from '../components/QualityTable.vue';import SampleCloud from '../components/SampleCloud.vue';onMounted(runs.load);const result=computed(()=>(runs.items.value.find(r=>r.id==='demo-run')||runs.items.value.find(r=>r.status==='completed'))?.result)</script><template><PageHeading index="00 / 配方总览" title="名义成本低，还要看固定配方的波动。" note="先求线性最小成本配比，再固定比例，在声明的原浆属性独立均匀扰动下做拉丁超立方试算。不是工业质量认证。"/><template v-if="result?.lp.feasible"><BlendMetrics :result="result"/><div class="formula-overview"><section><div class="ledger-heading"><h2>名义配方与质量余量</h2><a href="#/results">打开运行底稿 ↗</a></div><RecipeBars :rows="result.lp.shares.filter((r:any)=>r.share>1e-8)"/><QualityTable :rows="result.lp.qualities"/></section><aside class="margin-note"><p class="eyebrow">FIXED FORMULA / UNCERTAINTY</p><h2>同一配方，{{result.robustness.n_samples}}次扰动</h2><SampleCloud :result="result"/><p>绿色点满足全部质量界限；铜色点至少一项超界。比例在所有样本中固定，不逐样本重新优化。</p><p>质量边界比较绝对容差 {{result.robustness.comparison_tolerance}}（各属性自身单位）。成本{{result.robustness.perturb_cost?'同时扰动':'保持固定'}} · {{result.robustness.dimension_count}}个LHS潜在维度。</p></aside></div><section class="workflow-strip"><div><b>01 / 原浆</b><h3>价格、属性与供给界限</h3><p>每种原浆记录中心值和合法扰动区间。</p></div><div><b>02 / 配比</b><h3>求一个名义最优解</h3><p>不可行就保留原因，不编造替代配方。</p></div><div><b>03 / 波动</b><h3>固定比例，重新评价</h3><p>合规通过数和成本分位一并留档。</p></div></section></template></template>
